ModuleKreaTaxMatchDesc=Automates reconciliation between AT e-Fatura purchase records and Dolibarr supplier invoices.
ModuleKreaTaxMatchDescLong=KreaTaxMatch authenticates against AT e-Fatura, downloads purchase documents for a selected period, stores them with deduplication, matches them against Dolibarr supplier invoices by supplier VAT and supplier reference, highlights discrepancies, preserves manual matches, and supports daily cron synchronization.
